WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.010
The prophet Jeremiah hears God say:
before I formed you in the womb,

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.420
I knew you.

3
00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:09.580
Yet doctors weigh quality
of life every day:

4
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:13.580
pain, independence, the
ability to enjoy life.

5
00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:17.780
And Christians themselves disagree about
how far quality of life should count

6
00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.360
in hard cases.

7
00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:25.470
So if every life is sacred, should
anyone ever judge how good a life is?

8
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.840
In this mission, you'll
unpack two big ideas:

9
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.030
the sanctity of life,
and the quality of life.

10
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.650
Then you'll test the two
ideas against each other,

11
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.140
and weigh up which should matter more.

12
00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.190
Your mission: weigh up whether anyone
should ever judge how good a life is.
